This app is an iPhone reimplementation, in TypeScript and Swift, of parts of Shrike
(https://github.com/privkeyio/shrike, https://shrikewallet.com), an unofficial fork of Sparrow Wallet
(https://github.com/sparrowwallet/sparrow) that follows the BLAKE2b proof-of-work fork. Shrike and Sparrow
are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Parts of this app are ported from Shrike and its drongo library (https://github.com/privkeyio/drongo) and
were rewritten in TypeScript for this app, which changes them from the originals:

  src/core/replay.ts     the replay protection decision (AppServices.chainDecision and heightDecision)
  src/core/sighash.ts    the unified opt-in signature hash
  src/core/sign.ts       signing rules, including drongo's low-R signature grinding
  src/core/txbuilder.ts  coin selection and change, modeled on Sparrow's
  src/core/sync.ts       compatibility with Sparrow's Cormorant watch-only wallet on Bitcoin Core/Knots
  src/core/explorer.ts   block explorer links, as Shrike builds them

